# Discord Music Bot

Discord music bot built with Node.js and discord.js.

## Features

- Search tracks using Audius API
- Play music in voice channels
- Queue management
- Skip / previous / restart
- Pause / resume
- Shuffle
- Track and queue loop modes
- Listening history
- Automatic playback of queued tracks

## Tech Stack

- Node.js
- JavaScript
- discord.js
- @discordjs/voice
- Axios
- FFmpeg
- Audius API

## Installation

1. Clone repository
2. Install dependencies
3. Create .env
4. Add required tokens/API keys
5. Run the bot

## Environment Variables

DISCORD_TOKEN=
CLIENT_ID=
GUILD_ID=
AUDIUS_API_KEY=

## Run

npm start
